  (text "DISPLAY: HH:MM:SS.mmmm, 10 digits on five Kingbright DC56-11 duals, each digit statically driven by a 74HCT595 (5 V)." (at 190 22 0) (effects (font (size 3 3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid be0ad0a1-6a05-5e9e-b147-081edd8c566c))
  (text "Chain: SR_DATA -> U11 -> U12 ... -> U20. All latch together on SR_LATCH. /OE = PWM brightness." (at 190 28 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 44f11338-c2c8-594b-8ac6-72018f48b8eb))
  (text "Segment resistors 470R: ~5.7-6.4 mA per LED. 8 LEDs per 595 (~46-51 mA); U12/U14 drive 9 (~51-58 mA). Limit 70 mA." (at 190 33 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 59351181-a442-5fdb-b958-56c0944fd571))
